+
+### Production WEPPcloud credential renewal
+
+The wepp2 integration supports `WEPPCLOUD_TOKEN_FILE`; when set, each task reads that file instead of `WEPPCLOUD_TOKEN`. Missing or invalid configured files fail explicitly. The wepp1 systemd renewal service installs the credential at `/app/instance/.weppcloud-auth/token` through the existing instance mount, so rotations require no application restart. Canonical operator instructions: `/workdir/wepppy/docs/culvert-at-risk-integration/jwt-renewal.md`. Environment-only deployments retain `WEPPCLOUD_TOKEN` support when no file is configured.
